s Akito, and, having known him for about a year, considers him a friend. She's a great driver but doesn't know much else about cars, and has a terrible memory for the roads she travels - making him a perfect match for her as navigator."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official English site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c2578"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"走り屋チーム「四ツ谷フォーナイツ」のメンバー。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公とはバイト仲間で、ちょっといい感じになっていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし、涼風がレースを始めると、主人公から離れて涼風の傍に。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんな燐華の真意とは!?"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24042","sourceWorkId":"8666","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"“チーム「四ツ谷フォーナイツ」のマスコット”"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"車名：スズキ　カプチーノ"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"詳細：1995年モデル　5速MT"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公と同じコンビニで働くアルバイト仲間。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公とはかれこれ1年の付き合いで、親友と呼べる存在。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"車は好きだが、彼女は走らせる専門でそれ以外の知識は全くない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"元で有名なチーム「四ツ谷フォーナイツ」のメンバーで、バリバリの走り屋。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ドライビングテクニックはかなりのものだが、戦略やコースを覚えることが苦手なため、いままで一度もバトルで勝利したことがない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「せっかくこんなカワイイ女の子が迎えに来てあげたってのに、車ばっかり見てるって、どういうつもりなの！」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"139543"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f9/f94f8f06da79fcc7c71631ae34f0667d4ccb19fd20b8fb13afb20fb1ca59a7b5.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/18/182ab2c3fe245ccb47e066251c5cea8642e9d85d107825d74cd56f33be4d9dd2.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"民安ともえ","creatorId":"vndb:s23","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s23","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s23","name":"民安 ともえ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:328193:139543:5900:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c2579","characterName":"東堂院 麗子","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"139544","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"328193"}],"egsCharacterIds":["24043"],"vndbCharacterId":"c2579"},"originalCharacterName":"東堂院 麗子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"20"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A rich girl with a closeted upbringing, who travels with a faithful butler everywhere she goes. She could buy any car she wanted, but for some reason her favorite is a familiar older model. She's rather clueless and airheaded about most things, but when behind the wheel she demonstrates fearless driving technique."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official English site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c2579"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"東堂院財閥のご令嬢。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"財閥の全てを受け継ぎ、レースの世界に参戦。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"父の形見「ハチロク」で麗子自身もレースに参加しつつ、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"優秀なドライバーを探していた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんな折、彗星のごとく現れた主人公に注目し、オファーを出してくる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24043","sourceWorkId":"8666","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"“世間知らずのお嬢様”"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"車名：トヨタ　スプリンタートレノ"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"詳細：AE86　5速MT"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"有名な財閥の一人娘。生粋のお嬢様。かたわらにはいつも執事がひかえている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"車にはどれだけお金をかけているか想像できないが、なぜか愛車は古いハチロク。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"普段は世間知らずで常識知らず、天然系タイプの女性だが、ハンドルを握るとものすごいドライビングテクニックを発揮する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「…彰人さま、ゲームセンターで遊ぶのはまた今度にしますわ…。監視つきでは、楽しめませんもの…。」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"139544"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/83/8379e088f386d6a821b19bc77602274ae09c34170a85b8a9f4afb288a93932e9.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3b/3b95e00464bb5d551734ae198cba595291c25264cb1b25f7108d13691256c11a.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"小林和実","creatorId":"vndb:s2892","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2892","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2892","name":"小林 和実","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:328193:139544:65239:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c2580","characterName":"鳴守 ケイ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"139546","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"328193"}],"egsCharacterIds":["24045"],"vndbCharacterId":"c2580"},"originalCharacterName":"鳴守 ケイ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"19"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The ghost of a girl who died in a car accident on the Yotsuya ridge many years ago. Ever since then she can be seen at times racing in her 70's vintage car down the mountain pass."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official English site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c2580"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の前に突然現れ、自分のチームに誘う謎の少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その正体は、血の繋がっていない主人公の妹。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"生き別れた兄を知り、その活動をサポートすべく、素性を隠して、主人公にオファーを出す。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24045","sourceWorkId":"8666","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"“幽霊レーサー”"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"車名：日産　スカイライン　GT－R（ハコスカ）"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"詳細：1970年モデル　2000GT－R"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"昔、四ツ谷峠に命を掛け事故死した少女の幽霊。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"現世に未練を残し、愛車であったハコスカに乗って、何十年も峠を彷徨っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「○○じゃないし……すぐ眠くなるなんてことない……。」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"139546"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/dd/dd414a0a1eb0b5311008bc0544bb66afdc4ad74edf25f9b6772c0548be38eb97.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b9/b91f1d950a515b81a3371d620fe448fac6bfd16a7c41d46494b41cafeb731e67.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"計名 さや香","creatorId":"vndb:s859","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s859","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s859","name":"計名 さや香","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:22316","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c2581","characterName":"朝霧 友美","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"139545","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"328193"}],"egsCharacterIds":["24044"],"vndbCharacterId":"c2581"},"originalCharacterName":"朝霧 友美","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"19"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A girl in love with Yuu, leader of the Yotsuya Four Knights racing team. She's confessed to him many times and been turned down each time, perhaps due to her shyness and awkward manner of roundabout speech..."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"from official English site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c2581"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"TGTCのレースクィーンをしているフリータレント。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"峠を走っていた主人公と偶然知り合い、好意を抱いた友美は、以後、個人スポンサーとして主人公をバックアップしようとする。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24044","sourceWorkId":"8666","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"“祐に憧れる少女”"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"乗車車種：なし"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「四ツ谷フォーナイツ」のリーダーである涼風祐に憧れる少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"何度も涼風祐に告白をしているが、その度に断られて撃沈している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"内気な性格で、要領を得ない話し方のため、しばしば人に誤解される。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「だから、私の話を最後まで聞いてくれるなんて、いい人なんだな、と思って、うれしかったんです。」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"139545"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/20/20946fd94beb0ea5c800996ef5a55efd95dfb4917f3bdcee28b2b114705c6efb.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d0/d015fd01fe9d643c491f6e94fd94466e8c3bebf9b57d724b3c1f4fe5eb2bd1f8.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"米島希","creatorId":"vndb:s281","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s281","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s281","name":"米島 希","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:328193:139545:8055:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c2577","characterName":"槌田　彰人","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c2577"},"originalCharacterName":"槌田　彰人","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Akito is a college student who works part time to fund his addiction to racing games at the local arcade."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"from official English site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c2577"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c55472","characterName":"涼風 佑","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c55472"},"originalCharacterName":"涼風 佑","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Vehicle Type: BNR34 Nissan Skyline GT-R"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Plate Number: Tsukuba 330 R ・・ 34"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCh